{
  "name": "Chatbot - Send Answer to User",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions\n- **Sub-workflow trigger:** Acceptance criteria require **Execute Workflow Trigger** (not a webhook).\n- **Input contract:** Caller passes `chatId` and `aiResponseText` (matches **Chatbot - Generate AI Response** output).\n- **Telegram only:** Sends via **Telegram API** credential; no backend HTTP calls.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "10111213-1415-1617-1819-1a1b1c1d1e1f",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "21222324-2526-2728-2930-313233343536",
      "name": "Sub-Workflow Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst chatId = item.chatId;\nconst text = item.aiResponseText;\n\nif (chatId === null || chatId === undefined || chatId === '') {\n  throw new Error('chatId is required to send a Telegram answer');\n}\nif (typeof text !== 'string' || !text.trim()) {\n  throw new Error('aiResponseText is required to send a Telegram answer');\n}\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      chatId,\n      aiResponseText: text.trim(),\n    },\n  },\n];"
      },
      "id": "32333435-3637-3839-3a3b-3c3d3e3f4041",
      "name": "Prepare Outbound Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.aiResponseText }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "42434445-4647-4849-4a4b-4c4d4e4f5051",
      "name": "Send Telegram Answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "Telegram API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "s1",
              "name": "sent",
              "value": true,
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2",
              "name": "chatId",
              "value": "={{ $('Prepare Outbound Message').item.json.chatId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s3",
              "name": "aiResponseText",
              "value": "={{ $('Prepare Outbound Message').item.json.aiResponseText }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s4",
              "name": "telegramMessageId",
              "value": "={{ $json.result && $json.result.message_id ? $json.result.message_id : null }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "52535455-5657-5859-5a5b-5c5d5e5f6061",
      "name": "Message Delivered",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e1",
              "name": "stage",
              "value": "send-answer-to-user",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2",
              "name": "error",
              "value": true,
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "e3",
              "name": "errorMessage",
              "value": "={{ $json.error && $json.error.message ? $json.error.message : 'Telegram message send failed' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "62636465-6667-6869-6a6b-6c6d6e6f7071",
      "name": "Handle Send Error",
